# ==============================================================================
# Docker Ignore - ISO 27001:2022 Compliant (Control 8.28)
# Principle of Least Privilege: Exclude everything, allow only required app files.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Block everything by default to minimize attack surface and context size
*

# 2. Allow core application modules and runtime files
!api/
!infrastructure/
!model/
!services/
!utils/
!main.py
!requirements.txt

# 3. Security Hardening: Exclude sensitive and development-only artifacts (Control 8.8)
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/.gitlab-ci.yml
**/.env*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.agent/

# 4. Performance Optimization: Exclude Python build artifacts and cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# 5. Exclude non-runtime documentation and CI scripts
**/ci/
**/*.md
**Running.txt
